        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "413e5381-02ea-5b6e-bf74-e778576bde96",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide\n- People: Jim Jones\n- Organizations: Nailbomb, Peoples Temple\n- Events: 1995 Dynamo Open Air Festival\n- Places: Jonestown, northwestern Guyana\n- Topics: live albums, album covers\n\nFacts:\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide is a live album by Nailbomb.\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide captures Nailbomb's only live appearance at the 1995 Dynamo Open Air Festival.\n- The album cover of Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide shows the ruins of Jonestown.\n- Jonestown was a remote settlement in northwestern Guyana established by the Peoples Temple.\n- The Peoples Temple was an American socialist organization led by Jim Jones.",
